# p5 mcp: the status line names a project server waiting for approval once
# servers settle, and stops once a prompt is sent (1ef19394).
# The stdio server is p5-mcp-stdio.ts, which the profile names by `@BUN@` and
# `@SCENARIOS@` (capture.sh writes both in), and xfx is given the same profile.
work p5-mcp-ws
fx: homefile .fx/mcp.json p5-mcp-turn-profile.json
xfx: homefile .xfx/mcp.json p5-mcp-turn-profile.json
gateway p5-mcp-hello.json
wait 13
snap settled
key Escape
wait 0.5
type hello
key Enter
wait 4
snap after-prompt
